{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q675176","formula":"Bi·Ga·In·Sb·Sn","hill":"BiGaInSbSn","elements":["Ga","In","Sn","Sb","Bi"],"composition":{"Bi":1.0,"Ga":1.0,"In":1.0,"Sb":1.0,"Sn":1.0},"names":{"en":"Galinstan","ru":"Галинстан","uk":"Галінстан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Galinstan is a brand name for an alloy composed of gallium, indium, and tin which melts at −19 °C (−2 °F) and is thus liquid at room temperature. In scientific literature, galinstan is also used to denote the eutectic alloy of gallium, indium, and tin, which melts at around +11 °C (52 °F). The commercial product Galinstan is not a eutectic alloy, but a near-eutectic alloy.","ru":"Галинстан (нем. Galinstan) — торговая марка сплава с заявленным составом 68,5 % галлия, 21,5 % индия и 10 % олова. Торговая марка принадлежит немецкой компании Geratherm Medical AG. В русском языке подобные сплавы известны как ингас (от эмпирической формулы InGaSn).","uk":"Галінстан (англ. Galinstan™) — торгова марка легкоплавкого евтектичного сплаву, що перебуває у рідкому стані за кімнатної температури, із заявленим складом 68,5% галію, 21,5% індію і 10% олова. Торгова марка належить німецькій компанії Geratherm Medical AG. Назва сплаву складена з початкових букв латиномовних назв компонентів: GALium, INdium, STANnum."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q2519914","names":{"en":"brand name","ru":"имя бренда"}},{"qid":"Q37756","names":{"en":"alloy","ru":"сплав","uk":"сплави"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q675176","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galinstan","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%96%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Galinstan_on_glass.jpg","license":"Public domain"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q904655","formula":"Bi·In·Sn","names":{"en":"Field's metal","uk":"Сплав Філда"},"elements":["In","Sn","Bi"],"fame":12,"kind":null},{"id":"Q418807","formula":"GaSb","names":{"en":"Gallium antimonide","ru":"Антимонид галлия"},"elements":["Ga","Sb"],"fame":19,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q131298597","formula":"Bi·In·Pb·Sn","names":{"en":"Cerrolow 136"},"elements":["In","Sn","Pb","Bi"],"fame":2,"kind":null},{"id":"Q418679","formula":"InSb","names":{"en":"Indium antimonide","ru":"Антимонид индия"},"elements":["In","Sb"],"fame":20,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q15628080","formula":"InTe","names":{"en":"Indium(I,III) telluride","ru":"Теллурид индия(II)"},"elements":["In","Te"],"fame":2,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q18211897","formula":"NdBi₂","names":{"en":"Neodymium dibismuthide","ru":"Дивисмутид неодима"},"elements":["Nd","Bi"],"fame":1,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q18397781","formula":"IrSn₂","names":{"en":"Iridium distannide","ru":"Дистаннид иридия"},"elements":["Sn","Ir"],"fame":1,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q18397721","formula":"Ir₃Sn₇","names":{"en":"Tri-iridium heptastannide","ru":"Гептастаннид трииридия"},"elements":["Sn","Ir"],"fame":1,"kind":"crystal"}],"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/Galinstan_on_glass.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Galinstan_on_glass.jpg","license":"Public domain","author":"Splarka at English Wikipedia","licenseUrl":null}}